cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "skyforge-fc: bare-metal STM32F405 flight controller firmware"
authors:
  - name: "the skyforge-fc authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/coopersimpson101-debug/skyforge-fc"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Bare-metal flight controller firmware for 5-inch FPV quadcopters on the STM32F405:
  Madgwick and error-state EKF attitude estimation, cascaded PID control, a quad-X mixer,
  DShot and CRSF protocols, and a closed-loop rigid-body simulator that runs the same flight code.
keywords:
  - flight controller
  - STM32
  - embedded
  - control systems
  - EKF
  - DShot
  - CRSF
  - quadcopter
